    "semantic_summary": "This component is responsible for dynamically generating a hierarchical menu structure listing all available asset types within the project. It introspects metadata from ObjectInstanciator, filters out internal types, and builds a structured IAsset tree. It acts as a presentation layer, consuming engine state to expose a 'create' output emitter for triggering asset creation actions."
